    D(5^7) = D(   78125) =    -121094

    D(7^1) = D(       7) =        -12
    D(7^2) = D(      49) =        -83
    D(7^3) = D(     343) =       -580
    D(7^4) = D(    2401) =      -4059
    D(7^5) = D(   16807) =     -28412

    D(11^1) = D(      11) =        -20
    D(11^2) = D(     121) =       -219
    D(11^3) = D(    1331) =      -2408
    D(11^4) = D(   14641) =     -26487

    D(13^1) = D(      13) =        -24
    D(13^2) = D(     169) =       -311
    D(13^3) = D(    2197) =      -4042
    D(13^4) = D(   28561) =     -52545

  Pattern: D(p^a) < 0 for all prime powers with p >= 2, a >= 1.
  D(p) = (1+p) - 2p - (p-1) = 2 - 2p < 0 for p >= 2.
  D(p^2) = (1+p+p^2) - 2p^2 - p(p-1) = 1+p+p^2-2p^2-p^2+p = 1+2p-2p^2.
  For p=2: 1+4-8 = -3. For p=3: 1+6-18 = -11. Always negative for p>=2.

